{"logId": "b8de1e53-0cc1-4cfd-89c1-63a878680dd7", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [312, 121, 880, 165], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[311.7493591308594, 125.07362365722656], [879.0001220703125, 121.00001525878906], [879.2801513671875, 159.9980010986328], [312.0294189453125, 164.0716094970703]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：不因父母问题造成精神包袱和家庭矛盾。（底线原则）", "block_bbox": [309, 231, 1168, 263], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[309.0, 231.0], [1168.0, 231.0], [1168.0, 263.0], [309.0, 263.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：不因父母问题造成长期的精神困扰或有解决不了的家庭矛盾，这是家庭相处的底线原则。无论存在什么样的问题，都要积极地往好的方向上引导，至少不造成长期的“心病”，不造成精神压力和生活困扰。", "block_bbox": [308, 298, 1553, 421], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[308.0, 298.0], [1553.0, 298.0], [1553.0, 421.0], [308.0, 421.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [311, 487, 482, 519], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[311.0, 487.0], [482.0, 487.0], [482.0, 519.0], [311.0, 519.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、根据个人/家庭收入情况和父母经济情况，合理给予双方父母收入的10%以内生活上的照顾", "block_bbox": [335, 545, 1425, 578], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 545.0], [1425.0, 545.0], [1425.0, 578.0], [335.0, 578.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（经济照顾的原则是量力而行，如果是新员工刚入职或没有经济基础时，优先安排好的首先是自己，可以不给或少给，随着收入的增加或不同级别的收入情况，合理地给予。一方面保障父母生活，一方面也不能超过收入的10%，保障自己提升品位和享受生活。）", "block_bbox": [336, 590, 1554, 712], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 590.0], [1554.0, 590.0], [1554.0, 712.0], [336.0, 712.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、不背负父母的责任和压力，要明白首先让自己轻松幸福，才能真正带动父母也幸福", "block_bbox": [334, 725, 1332, 757], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[334.0, 725.0], [1332.0, 725.0], [1332.0, 757.0], [334.0, 757.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[54]", "block_bbox": [911, 967, 962, 994], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[911.0, 967.0], [961.0, 967.0], [961.0, 993.0], [911.0, 993.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8922548294067383, "coordinate": [312, 121, 880, 165], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[311.7493591308594, 125.07362365722656], [879.0001220703125, 121.00001525878906], [879.2801513671875, 159.9980010986328], [312.0294189453125, 164.0716094970703]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8359333872795105, "coordinate": [309, 231, 1168, 263], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[309.0, 231.0], [1168.0, 231.0], [1168.0, 263.0], [309.0, 263.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9510061144828796, "coordinate": [308, 298, 1553, 421], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[308.0, 298.0], [1553.0, 298.0], [1553.0, 421.0], [308.0, 421.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8413100242614746, "coordinate": [311, 487, 482, 519], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[311.0, 487.0], [482.0, 487.0], [482.0, 519.0], [311.0, 519.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6257477402687073, "coordinate": [335, 545, 1425, 578], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[335.0, 545.0], [1425.0, 545.0], [1425.0, 578.0], [335.0, 578.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8020285367965698, "coordinate": [336, 590, 1554, 712], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 590.0], [1554.0, 590.0], [1554.0, 712.0], [336.0, 712.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.877356231212616, "coordinate": [334, 725, 1332, 757], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[334.0, 725.0], [1332.0, 725.0], [1332.0, 757.0], [334.0, 757.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.5789854526519775, "coordinate": [911, 967, 962, 994], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[911.0, 967.0], [961.0, 967.0], [961.0, 993.0], [911.0, 993.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）\n\n## 一 级【0~1分】：不因父母问题造成精神包袱和家庭矛盾。（底线原则）\n\n- 本条释义：不因父母问题造成长期的精神困扰或有解决不了的家庭矛盾，这是家庭相处的底线原则。无论存在什么样的问题，都要积极地往好的方向上引导，至少不造成长期的“心病”，不造成精神压力和生活困扰。\n\n## - 符合的行为：\n\n1、根据个人/家庭收入情况和父母经济情况，合理给予双方父母收入的10%以内生活上的照顾\n\n（经济照顾的原则是量力而行，如果是新员工刚入职或没有经济基础时，优先安排好的首先是自己，可以不给或少给，随着收入的增加或不同级别的收入情况，合理地给予。一方面保障父母生活，一方面也不能超过收入的10%，保障自己提升品位和享受生活。）\n\n2、不背负父母的责任和压力，要明白首先让自己轻松幸福，才能真正带动父母也幸福", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//b8de1e53-0cc1-4cfd-89c1-63a878680dd7/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A32%3A28Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc6e8c93c06eb03778d72165f8644356a56801cd6527203b969e2eb8626f23efe"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//b8de1e53-0cc1-4cfd-89c1-63a878680dd7/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A32%3A28Z%2F-1%2F%2Fe81015b211d9c26fb1b8ed5f7ebe3c58c18878f9c51de0bb8dc85586b57b767c"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//b8de1e53-0cc1-4cfd-89c1-63a878680dd7/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A32%3A28Z%2F-1%2F%2F14f05fe1944908